<title>USA: TCI unit gets U.S. Air Force contract.</title>
<headline>TCI unit gets U.S. Air Force contract.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCI International Inc said its Technology for Communications International (TCI) unit has signed a contract to provide to the U.S. Air Force a flexible high-band transmitting antenna.</p>
<p>The contract amount of $5,155,521 is for the design, manufacture, installation and testing of the antenna.  The contract is to be executed within the next 18 months.</p>
